            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No signal. Check the actual signal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号の名前、知らせ方、音、振動は、交差点の画面で各信号の設定ボタン（VoiceOver ではアクション）から変えられます。この端末にだけ保存し、送信しません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change a signal’s name, announcements, sound and vibration with its settings button on the intersection screen (with VoiceOver, its actions). They are stored on this device only and never sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号の周期や、どの番号がどの横断歩道かを調べるため、受信したデータの提供にご協力いただけますか。集まったデータから求めた信号の周期は、協力している人の試験版（TestFlight）のアプリに「次の青の始まり」の推定として示します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To learn signal cycles and which number belongs to which crossing, would you share the data you receive? The signal cycles worked out from the shared data are shown in the test version (TestFlight) of the app of everyone who shares, as estimates of the next start of green."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号の番号がどの横断歩道かは、まだ確認できていません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which crossing each signal number belongs to has not been confirmed yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号や「残り目安」が変わった時刻と、それぞれが続いた時間（どちらも 0.1 秒単位）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When signals and the remaining-time indication changed, and how long each lasted (both to 0.1 s)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信号を受信しているあいだは推定を表示しません。受信中の信号をご覧ください。": {
      "localizations": {
