    "収集中の観測": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Observations being collected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "受け取ったデータからは、交差点の信号ごとの周期と青になる時刻をまとめた時刻表も作り、実測データの提供に協力している人の試験版（TestFlight）のアプリに「推定」として示します。時刻表に個々の利用者の情報は含まれません。協力をやめると、端末に保存した時刻表は削除します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The received data is also used to build timing plans with the cycle and green start time of each signal, which are shown as estimates in the test version (TestFlight) of the app of everyone who shares field data. The timing plans contain no information about individual users. When you stop sharing, the timing plans stored on your device are deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
