    "周りにある Bluetooth 機器のおおよその数（混み具合の目安。機器の識別子は送りません）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The approximate number of Bluetooth devices nearby, as a sign of how crowded it is (no device identifiers are sent)"
