      }
    },
    "完了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "実機受信中のパケットだけを記録します。記録にあなたの現在地は含まれませんが、交差点 ID と交差点の位置、受信した時刻は含まれるため、いつどの交差点にいたかは分かります。送信機は E1、E2… と表記します。記録は共有するまで端末の外に出ません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only packets received live are recorded. Recordings do not contain your location, but they do contain the intersection ID, the intersection's position and the time of reception, so they show when you were at which intersection. Transmitters are named E1, E2, …. Recordings stay on the device until you share them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "実測データの提供": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Field Data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "実測データの提供のお願い": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Help with Field Data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "実測データの提供をオンにすると、どの番号がどの横断歩道の信号かを記録できます（テスター向け）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
