    "推定、%@、%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimate, %@, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推定、%@、%@、この時間帯の推定はありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimate, %@, %@, no estimate for this time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推定、%@、%@、次の青の始まり、およそ %lld〜%lld 秒後": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimate, %@, %@, next start of green in about %lld to %lld seconds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推定は、集まった実測データから求めた信号の周期と青の始まりの時刻（時刻表）からの計算です。周期が決まっていない信号や、祝日・年末年始には出ません。受信した信号と 5 秒より大きくずれた時間帯は、その日のうちは出しません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimates are calculated from timing plans: the signal cycles and the times green starts, worked out from shared field data. They are not shown for signals without a fixed cycle, on public holidays or over the New Year. A time period whose estimate was more than 5 seconds off a received signal is not shown for the rest of the day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推定は横断の判断に使えません。実際の信号と音響信号を必ず確かめてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never use estimates to decide when to cross. Always check the actual signal and the audible signal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "時刻表が古いため推定を表示しません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No estimates are shown because the timing plans are out of date."
          }
        }
      }
    },
