    "最終受信": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last received"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最終送信": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last sent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未受信": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not received"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "東": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "east"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "標準": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "横断歩道の対応を記録（テスター向け）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record Crosswalks (for Testers)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "横断歩道の手前で、渡る方向に iPhone を向けてから、その横断歩道の信号の番号を押してください。端末の向きと、交差点から見たおおまかな位置を記録して、実測データと一緒に送ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At the kerb, point your iPhone in the direction you would cross, then tap the number of that crosswalk’s signal. The direction your device faces and your rough position relative to the intersection are recorded and sent with the field data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "次の青の始まり　およそ %lld〜%lld 秒後（推定）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next start of green: in about %lld–%lld s (estimate)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "止まれ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "歩いているか、走っているか、自転車や車に乗っているか、止まっているか（iPhone のモーション判定による区分。歩行者と車を見分けるため）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whether you are walking, running, cycling, in a vehicle or standing still (a category from the iPhone's motion detection, to tell pedestrians from vehicles)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "残り目安 %lld / 8": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remaining about %lld of 8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "残り目安 %lld/8": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remaining %lld/8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "残り目安 —": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remaining —"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "渡り始めないで": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do not start crossing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状態": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "現在地が分からないため推定を表示しません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No estimates are shown because your location is unknown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "現地確認": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Field Check"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面が消えると受信が止まります。VoiceOver の画面カーテンを使うと、画面を暗くしたまま受信を続けられます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reception stops when the screen turns off. With VoiceOver’s Screen Curtain, the screen stays dark while reception continues."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面を閉じたり、ほかのアプリに切り替えたりすると受信できません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing is received while the screen is off or another app is in front."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面を閉じている間は受信できません。表示を続けてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing is received while the screen is off or the app is in the background. Keep Aoshingo on screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "番号は信号データ内の並び順で、どの横断歩道の信号かは分かりません。現地で確かめた信号には、各信号の設定ボタンから名前を付け、知らせ方や音を変えられます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Numbers are the order in the signal data and do not tell which crossing a signal is for. For a signal you have checked on the spot, use its settings button to give it a name and change how it is announced and its sound."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "白黒と形だけで表示します。青は白地、赤は黒地です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Black, white and shapes only. Green is white, red is black."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "直近 30 秒の信号履歴（最大 5 件）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signal history, last 30 s (up to 5)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "知らせない信号：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not announced: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "知らせ方": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Announcements"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "短く 2 回": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two short"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "短く 3 回": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Three short"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "破棄したパケット：%lld 件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discarded packets: %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "確認しました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I Understand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末の向きが分からないため記録しませんでした。iPhone を水平に持って少し待ち、もう一度押してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not recorded because the direction your device faces is unknown. Hold your iPhone flat, wait a moment and tap again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "約 %@ km": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About %@ km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "約 %lld m": {
