            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Red"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "赤。止まってください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Red. Stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "近くに時刻表のある交差点はありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No intersection with timing plans nearby."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信した時刻（端末の時計が合っているかを確かめるためだけに使い、サーバーは保存しません）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The time of sending (used only to check that your device’s clock is right; the server does not store it)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信しないもの": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What is not sent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信するもの": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What is sent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信する内容が増えました。新しい内容を確かめて、協力するかどうかをもう一度選んでください。選ぶまでは何も送信しません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aoshingo now sends more data. Please review the new list and choose again whether to contribute. Nothing is sent until you choose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信待ちの報告": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reports waiting to be sent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信機の数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transmitters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通常は標準。iOS の「カラー以外で区別」がオンのときは色覚サポートになります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standard colors, switching to Color Vision Support when iOS “Differentiate Without Color” is on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "進める": {
