          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sound and Vibration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "高度化PICS に対応した交差点の近くで「受信開始」を押してください。対応交差点は全国で約 600 か所です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Near an intersection equipped with Advanced PICS, tap “Start Receiving”. There are about 600 such intersections in Japan."
          }
